--- a/CLAUDE.md
+++ b/CLAUDE.md
@@ -51,7 +51,7 @@ library — you install it *into* an existing repository with
 - **A cross-LLM pair-rail** — a second model (Codex) reviews canonical edits Claude proposes, so no single model is both author and sole reviewer.
