The four original cures are largely behaving as intended in the surrounding code. I have found one separate delivery regression in the latest cure commit: two plan-schema files were added to unconditional upgrade replacement, but they were not added to the shared ownership manifest, so customized adopter copies take the fallback overwrite path. I’m validating that path and the npm contract claims before fixing severity.
